== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[einn]]'' "[[one]]". Meaning '''twenty and one'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''[[tuttugu]] og [[einn]]'''

# [[twenty-one]], cardinal number after [[tuttugu]] and before [[tuttugu og tveir]]

